the ends of a transaction:
  committed: 1 , ended True
  Commit after the end: 21 the transaction has already been committed or rolled back
  Rollback after the end: 21 the transaction has already been committed or rolled back
  rolled back: 1 
  an exception of the work: the work failed, left 1 
  a rollback that fails after the work's exception: 19 UNIQUE constraint failed: t.id, left 1 
one transaction at a time:
  a transaction begun by BeginTx is open on this connection: commit it or roll it back before BeginImmediate
  a transaction that a BEGIN of Exec started is open on this connection: end it before BeginTx
savepoints:
  rolled back to: 1 10 
  a savepoint is open inside this transaction: end it before another
  released inside: 1 10 12 13 
  the outer one rolled back takes the released one: 1 10 , the inner ended True
  rolled back with one open inside: 1 10 , the inner ended True
  its name is released: no such savepoint: paslang_sp4
  a commit with savepoints open: 1 10 14 15 , they ended True
  a savepoint of an ended one: 21 the transaction has already been committed or rolled back
two routines on one connection:
  the other routine's row went with the rollback: 1 10 14 15 
two connections on a file:
  a second BeginImmediate: 5 database is locked
  a COMMIT under a reader: 5 database is locked, ended False
  then it commits: 2 rows, ended True
  a closed connection: 21 bad parameter or other API misuse
